<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Activation Code</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: "Segoe UI", "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            color: #000;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            padding: 30px;
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #000;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 5px 0;
        }

        .header img {
            height: 30px;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 20px 30px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 22px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .code {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #f0b90b;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        ul {
            padding-left: 20px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }

        a {
            color: #0056b3;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .footer {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #666;
            padding: 20px 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .socials {
            text-align: center;
            padding-top: 20px;
        }

        .socials img {
            margin: 0 6px;
            width: 24px;
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        .note {
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #888;
            margin-top: 20px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1 style="color: white;">IFish</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h1>Your New Journey Starts Now</h1>
            <p>Welcome to IFish. Confirm your registration by using the activation code below.</p>
            <p><strong>Account activation code:</strong></p>
            <div class="code">{{code}}</div>

            <p><strong>Security Tips :</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Never give your password to anyone.</li>
                <li>Never call any phone number from someone claiming to be IFish Customer Support.</li>
                <li>Enable <a href="#">Google Two-Factor Authentication</a>.</li>
                <li>For more information, visit <a href="#">15 Tips to Enhance Security for Your IFish
                        Account</a>.</li>
            </ul>

            <p>Don’t recognize this activity? Please <a href="#">reset your password</a> and contact <a
                    href="#">customer support</a> immediately.</p>
            <p><em>This is an automated message, please do not reply.</em></p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <div class="socials">
                <p><strong>Stay connected!</strong></p>
                <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/2111/2111463.png" alt="Facebook" />
                <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/733/733558.png" alt="LinkedIn" />
                <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/733/733590.png" alt="Instagram" />
                <img src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/512/1384/1384060.png" alt="YouTube" />
            </div>
            <div class="note">
                &copy; {{year}} IFish. All Rights Reserved.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>